s"}],[{"text":"MBA Investment Banking"},{"text":"Investment banking"}],[{"text":"PG in Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Finance + data"}],[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"Accounting, audit, taxation and finance"}],[{"text":"CFA"},{"text":"Investment management/research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"p","text":"For corporate finance:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Finance","Finance Internship","Financial Analyst","Senior Analyst","FP&A/Finance Manager","Finance Director/CFO"]},{"type":"p","text":"For investment analysis:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Finance","Equity Research/Investment Internship","Research/Investment Analyst","Senior Analyst","Portfolio/Research Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"An MBA is useful for progression, but strong modelling, analytical ability and relevant experience are more important for entering the profession."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Useful master's areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Finance, Financial Economics, Investment Management"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Finance, Financial Analytics, Business Analytics"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Finance, Financial Management, Business Analytics"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Applied Finance, Financial Management"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Finance, Financial Engineering, Business Analytics"}],[{"text":"🇭🇰 Hong Kong"},{"text":"Finance, Investment Management"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Finance, Financial Economics"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Finance, Economics, Business Analytics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For international finance careers, professional qualifications and local regulatory requirements vary by role and country."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Corporate finance / FP&A route"},{"type":"h","text":"BBA Finance"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":